    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνερμάτιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without ballast,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ τὰ ἀ. πλοῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					144a
				</span></i>
			; <i>unstable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				147.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τράπεζα</span> an <i>empty</i>
			table, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.704b
			</span></i>; <i>unstable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					413
				</span></i>
			; also of persons, <i>without ballast,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.501d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				1.8.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐαθέντα τὰ μεγάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					2.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
